---
// /luxury-car-rental-fll
//
// Owns "luxury car rental fll". "Exotic car rental fort lauderdale" belongs to
// the city page. This page is the airport only. The fee is the Fort Lauderdale
// row in rental-terms.js, and this page does not call that fee the Miami rate.
import ContentPhoto from '@/components/site/ContentPhoto.astro';
import LandingLayout from '@/layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
import { cars } from '@/data/cars';
import { business, telHref, whatsappWith } from '@/data/business';
import { rentalTerms } from '@/data/rental-terms';
import {
  deliveryHoursLabel,
  flightTrackingSentence,
  fortLauderdaleDelivery,
  lateFlightSentence,
  returnSentence,
  displayName,
} from '@/lib/delivery-facts';
import { deliveryBusinessSchema, faqSchema } from '@/lib/delivery-schema';

const PAGE = '/luxury-car-rental-fll';
const SITE = 'https://www.lussarocollection.com';
const PAGE_URL = `${SITE}${PAGE}`;

const bySlug = (slug) => cars.find((c) => c.slug === slug);
const named = displayName;

const urus = bySlug('lamborghini-urus');
const gls = bySlug('mercedes-maybach-gls-600');
const cullinan = bySlug('rolls-royce-cullinan');
const g63 = bySlug('mercedes-amg-g63');
const sto = bySlug('huracan-sto');

const waMessage = "Hi, I'd like the Lamborghini Urus delivered to Fort Lauderdale Airport (FLL).";
const wa = whatsappWith(waMessage, { car: urus.name, page: PAGE });

const description = `Luxury car rental to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport (FLL). Delivery is ${fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way, outside the Miami rate. The car comes from Miami.`;

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Do you deliver to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport (FLL)?',
    a: `Yes. The car comes from Miami to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport. Delivery is ${fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way because the airport is outside our local Miami area. We do not have a Fort Lauderdale office.`,
  },
  {
    q: 'How much is delivery to FLL?',
    a: `Delivery to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport is ${fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way. That is the published fee for this airport, not the Miami fee. The quote states it before you book.`,
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you have an office at the airport?',
    a: `No. The address is ${business.street}, ${business.city}, ${business.region} ${business.postalCode}. The airport is a delivery point, not a second branch.`,
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I fly in here and return the car in Miami, or at MIA?',
    a: 'No. There is no one-way return to Miami or to MIA. The return rule is stated once above, and in the terms.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if my flight is late?',
    a: `${lateFlightSentence} ${flightTrackingSentence} Hours are ${deliveryHoursLabel}.`,
  },
];

const schema = [
  deliveryBusinessSchema({
    pageUrl: PAGE_URL,
    areaServed: {
      '@type': 'Airport',
      name: 'Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport',
      iataCode: 'FLL',
    },
    description: `Luxury and exotic car rental delivered to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport at ${fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way.`,
    deliveryOffer: {
      name: 'Delivery to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport',
      price: fortLauderdaleDelivery.fee,
      description: `${fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way. Published fee for this airport, charged in addition to the daily rate.`,
    },
  }),
  faqSchema(faqs),
];
---
<LandingLayout
  title="Luxury Car Rental FLL | Fort Lauderdale Airport | Lussaro"
  description={description}
  h1="Luxury Car Rental at Fort Lauderdale Airport (FLL)"
  intro={`Lussaro Collection brings the car from Miami to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport. Delivery is ${fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way because the airport is outside our local Miami area. There is no office on site.`}
  heroImage="/cars/mercedes-maybach-gls-600-rental-miami-side-palms.jpg"
  showRating={false}
  bookingCar={urus.name}
  bookingSource={PAGE_URL}
  bookingCta="fll_hero"
  waMessage={waMessage}
  fleetHeading="SUVs for a flight into the airport"
  only={['lamborghini-urus', 'mercedes-maybach-gls-600', 'rolls-royce-cullinan']}
  fullFleetLink={true}
  ctaTitle="Book the Urus for FLL delivery"
  leadNote="Send the car, the dates, and your arrival window."
  bandSubtitle="Tell us the car and the dates. We reply with availability and the quote."
  formNote="Prefer to talk now? Call or WhatsApp us."
  schema={schema}
>
  <h2 id="short-answer">The short answer</h2>
  <p>This page is Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport (FLL) only. The car leaves {business.street}, {business.city}, and comes north to FLL. The fee is {fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way, the published Fort Lauderdale figure, because the airport is outside our local Miami area. We do not keep a Fort Lauderdale office, a counter, or a second address there.</p>
  <p>{returnSentence} There is no one-way return to Miami or to MIA. Read it in the <a href="/terms">terms</a>. Hours are {deliveryHoursLabel}.</p>
  <p>
    Call <a href={telHref} data-cta="fll_body" data-call-inline>{business.phoneDisplay}</a>
    or message <a href={wa} data-cta="fll_body" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
    The form opens on the {urus.name}.
  </p>
  <p>Hotels, Las Olas, and the beach are on <a href="/exotic-car-rental-fort-lauderdale">the city page</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="how-fll-delivery-works">How the airport delivery works</h2>
  <p>For FLL, tell us the car, the dates, and your arrival window. We reply with availability and the total, including the Fort Lauderdale delivery of {fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way. An eligible driver has to be present to take the car: {sto.minimumAge} or older on the Huracán STO, and {rentalTerms.minimumAge} or older on the other cars, with a valid driver's license and insurance that covers the rental.</p>
  <p>{flightTrackingSentence} {lateFlightSentence} Hours stay {deliveryHoursLabel}. The quote settles the timing. We do not publish a minute-by-minute plan.</p>

  <ContentPhoto src="/cars/lamborghini-urus-rental-miami-rear-palms.jpg" width={2928} height={2928} />

  <h2 id="what-delivery-costs">What delivery costs</h2>
  <p>Delivery to Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International Airport is {fortLauderdaleDelivery.display} each way. The FLL fee is not the Miami fee, and it is not inside the daily rate. Both published fees are on the <a href="/pricing">rate card</a>.</p>
  <p><a href="/luxury-car-rental-miami-airport">Miami International Airport</a> is the other airport page. The <a href="/car-rental-near-port-of-miami">Port of Miami</a> is a cruise delivery. Neither is a return point for a car that starts here.</p>

  <h2 id="which-cars">Cars that work after a flight</h2>
  <p>After a flight into FLL, luggage wants an SUV. The form starts on the <a href="/cars/lamborghini-urus">{urus.name}</a>. The <a href="/cars/mercedes-maybach-gls-600">{named(gls)}</a>, the <a href="/cars/rolls-royce-cullinan">{named(cullinan)}</a>, and the <a href="/cars/mercedes-amg-g63">{named(g63)}</a> are the other four-door cars. Daily and multi-day rates for a Fort Lauderdale airport rental are on the <a href="/pricing">pricing</a> page.</p>
  <p>The <a href="/cars/huracan-evo">Huracán EVO</a> and the <a href="/cars/sf90">Ferrari SF90</a> are the low cars, for when the drive matters more than the bags. The Huracán STO is track-bred, street-only. For a Lamborghini in general, use the <a href="/lamborghini-rental-miami">Lamborghini rental</a> page. The whole list is the <a href="/fleet">fleet</a>, and the Urus has a longer note on the <a href="/lamborghini-urus-rental-miami">Urus page</a>.</p>

  <ContentPhoto src="/cars/rolls-royce-cullinan-rental-miami-side-profile.jpg" width={1024} height={683} />

  <h2 id="what-the-daily-rate-includes">What the daily rate includes</h2>
  <p>The daily rate for a car that starts at this airport, including miles and the deposit, is on the <a href="/pricing">pricing</a> page and in the <a href="/terms">terms</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="prefer-to-be-driven">Prefer to be driven?</h2>
  <p>Chauffeur service in the {named(gls)}, instead of driving up from Miami yourself, is on the <a href="/chauffeur-service-miami">chauffeur page</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="questions">Questions</h2>
  {faqs.map((f) => (
    <>
      <h3>{f.q}</h3>
      <p>{f.a}</p>
    </>
  ))}
  <p>To write instead of book a car, use <a href="/contact">contact</a>.</p>
</LandingLayout>
